{"_meta":{"com.oxinsider/docs-group":"markets","securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["read"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get a market's net buyers and sellers"},"description":"One market's net buyers and net sellers over the last 24 hours or 7 days, live: the 0xinsider market page's wallets in/out panel for a Pro viewer. A wallet's net is its buys minus its sells in the window across both outcomes, in USD of matched notional, fees excluded.\n\nArgs:\n  - condition_id (string, required): Raw provider condition_id or the mkt_-prefixed market id\n  - window (string, optional): 24h (default) or 7d\n\nReturns: condition_id, window, window_start and window_end (the inclusive bounds the read used), summary (wallets_in and wallets_out, the count of wallets with a positive and a negative net over every wallet in the window, and net_usd, the sum of every net), net_buyers (largest net first) and net_sellers (most negative first), at most 25 each, each wallet with its address, display_name, current grade, net_usd, trades in the window and last_traded_at (its newest trade on any market, at or before window_end), plus meta. A wallet that bought and sold the same amount nets zero and is on neither list. Reads are cached for about a minute. A condition_id with no market page answers not_found; a market outside sports and esports answers market_out_of_scope.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"condition_id":{"description":"Raw provider condition_id or the mkt_-prefixed market id","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"window":{"description":"24h (the default) or 7d, ending at the read's clock","enum":["24h","7d"],"type":"string"}},"required":["condition_id"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_market_wallets_in_out","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"MarketWalletsInOut":{"properties":{"condition_id":{"type":"string"},"net_buyers":{"items":{"properties":{"address":{"type":"string"},"displa